      "claim": "Bosentan has human F about 50% (43-48% in healthy volunteers) and rat F 42±8%, supporting F>=20% for lipophilic heteroaromatic drugs.",
      "card_ids": ["C09","C12","C48","C54"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Erlotinib has human absolute F 59% (95% CI 55-63%) and complete oral bioavailability from solution in rats; L3 oral exposure shows AUC∞ 10.2 µg·h/mL after 150 mg fasted, consistent with meaningful absorption.",
      "card_ids": ["C17","C20","C45","C69"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "The only quantitative sub-20% L2 value (GSK269984A mouse F ~14%) is from a low-transfer context and conflicts with human L1 F 95% and >94%, so it does not affirm F<20% for the query.",
      "card_ids": ["C58","C02","C32"]
    }
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [
    {
      "family": "oral_auc_cmax_exposure",
